</div><p>The post <a href="https://allaboutfpl.com/2026/08/fpl-gw1-scout-picks-based-on-stats-analysis-and-matchups/">FPL GW1 Scout Picks Based on Stats, Analysis and Matchups</a> appeared first on <a href="https://allaboutfpl.com">ALLABOUTFPL: Your one stop place for all FPL tips, FPL captain picks, FPL news, FPL players, previews, reviews,differential picks, analysis and weekly updates.</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>Best Budget FPL Midfielders for 26/27 Season &#124; £4.5m to £6.0m</title>
		<link>https://allaboutfpl.com/2026/08/best-budget-fpl-midfielders-for-26-27-season-4-5m-to-6-0m/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jack Barrett]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 21:24:33 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Budget FPL midfielders]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[FPL Midfielders]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Game week Preview]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Ultimate 2026/27 FPL Pre-Season Guide]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[£4.5m - £5.0m FPL Midfielders]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[£6.0 million fpl midfielders]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[4.5 fpl midfielder]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[5.5 million fpl midfielders]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[budget enablers fpl]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Budget FPL Assets]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Budget Midfielders]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[enzo le fee]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[FANTASY PREMIER LEAGUE]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[FPL]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[fpl community]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[garner fpl]]></category>
