<div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter size-large"><a href="https://allaboutfpl.com/category/ultimate-2026-27-fpl-pre-season-guide/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="256" src="https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Colorful-Etsy-Banner-2026-07-19T135459.387-1024x256.png" alt="" class="wp-image-84022" srcset="https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Colorful-Etsy-Banner-2026-07-19T135459.387-1024x256.png 1024w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Colorful-Etsy-Banner-2026-07-19T135459.387-300x75.png 300w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Colorful-Etsy-Banner-2026-07-19T135459.387-768x192.png 768w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Colorful-Etsy-Banner-2026-07-19T135459.387-600x150.png 600w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Colorful-Etsy-Banner-2026-07-19T135459.387.png 1200w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></a><figcaption class="wp-element-caption"><a href="https://allaboutfpl.com/category/ultimate-2026-27-fpl-pre-season-guide/" data-type="link" data-id="https://allaboutfpl.com/category/ultimate-2026-27-fpl-pre-season-guide/"><strong><mark><mark style="background-color:#ffffff" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color">Link to all our pre-season content</mark></mark></strong></a> in one place &amp; for free!</figcaption></figure>
</div><p>The post <a href="https://allaboutfpl.com/2026/08/best-budget-fpl-midfielders-for-26-27-season-4-5m-to-6-0m/">Best Budget FPL Midfielders for 26/27 Season | £4.5m to £6.0m</a> appeared first on <a href="https://allaboutfpl.com">ALLABOUTFPL: Your one stop place for all FPL tips, FPL captain picks, FPL news, FPL players, previews, reviews,differential picks, analysis and weekly updates.</a>.</p>
