-5-million-fpl-defenders-for-the-2026-27-fpl-season/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color">Best £4.5 Million FPL Defenders for the 2026/27 FPL Season</mark></a></strong><br><strong><a href="https://allaboutfpl.com/2026/08/best-fpl-value-defenders-and-gks-for-the-2026-27-season/" data-type="link" data-id="https://allaboutfpl.com/2026/07/fpl-rotational-pairs-combinations-for-the-2026-27-fpl-season/"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color">Best Value for Money Defenders and GKs for 2026/27 FPL season<br></mark></a></strong><br><strong>Midfielders Series:<br><a href="https://allaboutfpl.com/2026/08/best-premium-fpl-midfielders-8-0-12-0-million-26-27-season/" data-type="link" data-id="https://allaboutfpl.com/2026/08/best-premium-fpl-midfielders-8-0-12-0-million-26-27-season/"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color">Best FPL Premium Midfielders(8.0-12.0) for 2026/27 FPL season</mark></a></strong><br><a href="https://allaboutfpl.com/2026/08/best-fpl-midfielders-at-each-price-point-for-the-2026-27-season/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color">Best FPL Midfielders at Each Price Point for the 2026/27 Season</mark></strong></a><br><a href="https://allaboutfpl.com/2026/08/best-mid-price-fpl-midfielders-for-the-26-27-season-6-5-to-7-5m/"><strong><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color">Best Mid-Price FPL Midfielders for the 26/27 Season | £6.5 to 7.5M</mark></strong></a><br><a href="https://allaboutfpl.com/2026/08/best-budget-fpl-midfielders-for-26-27-season-4-5m-to-6-0m/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color">Best Budge