					<description><![CDATA[<p>In this post, we will take a look at the 26/27 GW1 predicted lineups and expected formations of all 20 Premier League Teams. We will be updating the articles after the Friendlies and Latest injury updates, so don’t forget to bookmark the link and check back again close to the FPL GW1 deadline on Friday [&#8230;]</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://allaboutfpl.com/2026/08/2026-27-pl-season-predicted-gw1-lineups-of-all-20-pl-teams/">2026/27 PL Season: Predicted GW1 Lineups of All 20 PL Teams</a> appeared first on <a href="https://allaboutfpl.com">ALLABOUTFPL: Your one stop place for all FPL tips, FPL captain picks, FPL news, FPL players, previews, reviews,differential picks, analysis and weekly updates.</a>.</p>
