										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In this post, we will take a look at the 26/27 GW1 predicted lineups and expected formations of all 20 Premier League Teams. We will be updating the articles after the Friendlies and Latest injury updates, so don’t forget to bookmark the link and check back again close to the FPL GW1 deadline on Friday 21 Aug, 18:30 (BST)&#8230;</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Teams will be listed from right to left, starting with the goalkeeper. To give an example&#8230;</p>



<p class="has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph">Alisson<br>Frimpong, Araujo, Van Dijk, Kerkez<br>etc&#8230;</p>



<p class="has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph">This post will be in alphabetical order and will include any notes/injury and transfer updates that we deem necessary.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://allaboutfpl.com/category/ultimate-2026-27-fpl-pre-season-guide/" data-type="link" data-id="https://allaboutfpl.com/category/ultimate-2026-27-fpl-pre-season-guide/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color"><strong>Link to all our 2026/27 Pre-Season articles</strong></mark></a> including all team pre-season friendly updates, best drafts, fixture analysis, position-wise analysis, differentials, players to target, budget enablers and more. Completely free to access as well!</p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">FPL GW1 Predicted Lineups of All 20 PL Teams</h2>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">AFC Bournemouth</h2>



