					<description><![CDATA[<p>The Best Mid priced and Premium FPL Forwards (>6.0 million) are discussed based on Stats, Fixtures and Verdict is given. </p>
<p>The post <a href="https://allaboutfpl.com/2026/08/top-mid-priced-premium-fpl-forwards6-0-for-2026-27-season/">Top Mid Priced &amp; Premium FPL Forwards(&gt;6.0) for 2026/27 season</a> appeared first on <a href="https://allaboutfpl.com">ALLABOUTFPL: Your one stop place for all FPL tips, FPL captain picks, FPL news, FPL players, previews, reviews,differential picks, analysis and weekly updates.</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We will be continuing the Forward series by exploring the best mid-priced &amp; Premium Forwards in the (6+ Million price range).  These are the Big Guys in FPL, and although recently Forwards have been struggling to keep up with Midfielders and now Defcon Defenders, this could be the year when they make a magnificent return.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">There are currently 12 Forwards classified under this Category, and most of them will form the main source of attack in our FPL Teams throughout this season.</p>



