<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">Best Premium and Mid Prcied FPL Forwards(&gt;6.0 Million) for 2026/27 season</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>ICYMI- Part 1 of the Forwards Series: <a href="https://allaboutfpl.com/2026/08/best-fpl-budget-forwards-4-5-6-0-million-26-27-fpl-season/" data-type="link" data-id="https://allaboutfpl.com/2026/08/best-fpl-budget-forwards-4-5-6-0-million-26-27-fpl-season/"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color">Best Budget Forwards to consider for 2026/27 season based on Stats and Analysis</mark></a></strong></p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Erling Haaland – 15.5 Forward &#8211; Manchester City</strong></h3>


<div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter size-large is-resized"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="1024" src="https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/202627-FPL-Pre-Season-28-1024x1024.png" alt="" class="wp-image-84922" style="width:708px;height:auto" srcset="https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/202627-FPL-Pre-Season-28-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/202627-FPL-Pre-Season-28-300x300.png 300w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/202627-FPL-Pre-Season-28-150x150.png 150w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/202627-FPL-Pre-Season-28-768x768.png 768w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/202627-FPL-Pre-Season-28-600x600.png 600w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/202627-FPL-Pre-Season-28.png 1080w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>
</div>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Pros :</strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>The Main Man of FPL, now that Mo Salah has left the Premier League. He scored 27 Goals and got 8 Assists last season. He had 126 Shots, 114 Shots in the box, and 59 Shots on Target. He had 51 Big Chances and an xG of 25.43. All of these were league-leading stats, which made his position as the go-to forward justifiable.</li>
</ul>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading">Top Players for xG last season:</h4>


<div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter size-large is-resized"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" src="https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/top-10-xg-gw1-38-1-1024x768.png" alt="" class="wp-image-84921" style="width:757px;height:auto" srcset="https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/top-10-xg-gw1-38-1-1024x768.png 1024w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/top-10-xg-gw1-38-1-300x225.png 300w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/top-10-xg-gw1-38-1-768x576.png 768w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/top-10-xg-gw1-38-1-600x450.png 600w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/top-10-xg-gw1-38-1.png 1080w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>
</div>


<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>A stat all of you already know by now is that Erling Haaland starts the League season on fire. He has scored 10 Goals (67 points), 8 Goals (51 points), 10 Goals (65 points), and 8 Goals (62) points in the 1<sup>st</sup> 6 weeks of the League since joining the League. He gets to face 2 teams with new coaches (Bournemouth &amp; Palace) and then newly promoted Coventry in the 1<sup>st</sup> 3 Gameweeks. Do not be surprised if he gets a brace in all of these games and continues this trend of starting the FPL season on fire.</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Cons :</strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Pep is gone. How will City function without Pep? Will their attack be as fluent? All these are open questions, which need to be answered. But surely, class is permanent &amp; we all know Erling Haaland is class.</li>
</ul>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong><a href="https://go.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/ai-team-rating?utm_source=affiliate&amp;utm_medium=affiliates&amp;utm_campaign=allaboutfpl&amp;utm_content=team-rating&amp;via=allaboutfpl" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color">Fantasy Football Hub(FFHUB) Free AI Team Rating Tool</mark></a></strong></p>


<div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter size-full"><a href="https://go.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/ai-team-rating?utm_source=affiliate&amp;utm_medium=affiliates&amp;utm_campaign=allaboutfpl&amp;utm_content=team-rating&amp;via=allaboutfpl"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1000" height="596" src="https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/AAFPL_GYTR_1000x596.png" alt="" class="wp-image-84095" srcset="https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/AAFPL_GYTR_1000x596.png 1000w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/AAFPL_GYTR_1000x596-300x179.png 300w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/AAFPL_GYTR_1000x596-768x458.png 768w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/AAFPL_GYTR_1000x596-600x358.png 600w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px" /></a><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">Get your team rated by <strong><a href="https://go.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/ai-team-rating?utm_source=affiliate&amp;utm_medium=affiliates&amp;utm_campaign=allaboutfpl&amp;utm_content=team-rating&amp;via=allaboutfpl" data-type="link" data-id="https://go.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/ai-team-rating?utm_source=affiliate&amp;utm_medium=affiliates&amp;utm_campaign=allaboutfpl&amp;utm_content=team-rating&amp;via=allaboutfpl" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color">Fantasy Football Hub</mark></a></strong>&#8216;s AI Team Rating tool for free (Click on the image above to get your team rated).</figcaption></figure>
