<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Igor Thiago – 8.0 Forward &#8211; Brentford</strong></h3>


<div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter size-large is-resized"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" src="https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/thiago-landscape-1-1024x768.png" alt="" class="wp-image-84927" style="width:741px;height:auto" srcset="https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/thiago-landscape-1-1024x768.png 1024w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/thiago-landscape-1-300x225.png 300w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/thiago-landscape-1-768x576.png 768w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/thiago-landscape-1-600x450.png 600w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/thiago-landscape-1.png 1080w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>
</div>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Pros :</strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>The surprise package of last season, Thiago scored 22 Goals last season. He was ranked 2<sup>nd</sup> for Goals last season and also for Shots (84),  Shots in the Box (80), Shots on Target (41), and Big Chances (41).</li>



<li>Thiago is the Focal point of the Brentford attack and their talisman. He plays 90 minutes in most matches and is also Brentford’s designated penalty taker. Without European games, he seems to be free of rotation worries as well and has some solid games to start this season.</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Igor Thiago in pre-season: <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/26bd.png" alt="⚽" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><strong><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/26bd.png" alt="⚽" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/26bd.png" alt="⚽" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /></strong><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f170.png" alt="🅰" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /></strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Cons </strong>:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Having penalties is never a disadvantage, but can Brentford win another 8 penalties again this season? This could lead to a slight drop in Thiago’s goal numbers this season. Only time will tell.</li>
</ul>



