<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Hugo Ekitike&nbsp; – 7.5 Forward &#8211; Liverpool</strong></h3>


<img decoding="async" src="https://thumbs.smartframe.io/04742eb90cefa12a5e3ab9bae92c2b93/neimnS0Vc1PA.webp?force-scraper=rss&#038;t=rss" alt="SmartFrame Image" />


<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Pros :</strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Probably Liverpool’s best attacking player last season with 11 Goals and 4 Assists from just 21 starts. He is a quality player and will surely be back on the FPL radar when he returns from injury.</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Cons :</strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>The rotation with Alexander Isak will be a concern when he does return to action.</li>
</ul>



