					<description><![CDATA[<p>In this 26/27 PL pre-season summary blog, we summarize all the pre-season games of the 20 teams with all the goals &#038; assists from every game.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://allaboutfpl.com/2026/08/2026-27-pre-season-summary-of-all-20-premier-league-teams/">2026/27 Pre-Season Summary of All 20 Premier League Teams</a> appeared first on <a href="https://allaboutfpl.com">ALLABOUTFPL: Your one stop place for all FPL tips, FPL captain picks, FPL news, FPL players, previews, reviews,differential picks, analysis and weekly updates.</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In this 26/27 PL pre-season summary blog, we summarize all the pre-season games of the 20 teams with all the goals &amp; assists from every game.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://allaboutfpl.com/category/ultimate-2026-27-fpl-pre-season-guide/" data-type="link" data-id="https://allaboutfpl.com/category/ultimate-2026-27-fpl-pre-season-guide/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color"><strong>Link to all our 2026/27 Pre-Season articles</strong></mark></a> including all team pre-season friendly updates, best drafts, fixture analysis, position-wise analysis, differentials, players to target, budget enablers and more. Completely free to access as well!</p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">Pre-Season Summary of Premier League Teams</h2>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Arsenal Pre-Season Summary</h3>


<img decoding="async" src="https://thumbs.smartframe.io/b0c95bc04383cef69c6b47df872135cf/WmOBZN0cVDs9.webp?force-scraper=rss&#038;t=rss" alt="SmartFrame Image" />


<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Results: Played</strong>: 6, <strong>Won</strong>: 3, <strong>Lost</strong>: 2, <strong>Drawn</strong>: 1</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>25 July Arsenal&nbsp;</strong>3-0 MK Dons&nbsp;</li>



<li><strong>1 August</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Arsenal&nbsp;</strong>4-1 Girona&nbsp;</li>



<li><strong>5 August</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Arsenal&nbsp;</strong>1-3 Real Betis&nbsp;</li>



<li><strong>9 August</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Arsenal&nbsp;</strong>2-3 Borussia Dortmund</li>



<li><strong>12 August Arsenal&nbsp;</strong>1-1 Como</li>



<li><strong>16 August</strong> Arsenal 3 &#8211; 0 Man City </li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Arsenal Lineup in their last pre-season game:</strong></p>


<div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="680" height="680" src="https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-107.png" alt="" class="wp-image-84914" srcset="https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-107.png 680w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-107-300x300.png 300w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-107-150x150.png 150w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-107-600x600.png 600w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px" /></figure>
</div>


<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Arsenal Pre-Season Keynotes:</h3>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>White &#8211; Gabriel &#8211; Mosquera- Calafiori started as the back four in Arsenal&#8217;s last pre-season game. The same back line is expected to start in GW1 as well. Saka &amp; Rice were on the bench. </li>



<li>Tzolis has been in great form in pre-season, picking up 6 assists and scoring a goal. </li>



<li>Ben White had 11 DEFCONs in the Shield game vs Man City, the only player to hit the threshold from both sides. </li>
</ul>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Arsenal Friendlies Summary:</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Tzolis <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/26bd.png" alt="⚽" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f170.png" alt="🅰" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f170.png" alt="🅰" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f170.png" alt="🅰" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f170.png" alt="🅰" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f170.png" alt="🅰" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f170.png" alt="🅰" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> (£6.5 MID)<br>Nwaneri <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/26bd.png" alt="⚽" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/26bd.png" alt="⚽" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><br>Havertz <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/26bd.png" alt="⚽" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/26bd.png" alt="⚽" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><br>Dowman <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/26bd.png" alt="⚽" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f170.png" alt="🅰" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><br>Lewis Skelly <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/26bd.png" alt="⚽" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f170.png" alt="🅰" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f170.png" alt="🅰" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><br>Calafiori <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/26bd.png" alt="⚽" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f170.png" alt="🅰" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><br>Gyokeres <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/26bd.png" alt="⚽" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><br>Jesus <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/26bd.png" alt="⚽" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><br>Odegaard <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/26bd.png" alt="⚽" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><br>Hincapie <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/26bd.png" alt="⚽" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><br>Nelson <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/26bd.png" alt="⚽" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><br>White <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f170.png" alt="🅰" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><br>Martinelli <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f170.png" alt="🅰" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /></p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



