<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Coventry Pre-Season Keynotes:</h3>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Thomas was benched in the penultimate friendly vs Espanyol, with new signing Amenda &amp; Kitching preferred for the CB spots. He did return to the lineup, partnering Amenda in their final friendly vs Monaco and even hit DEFCON as per <strong><a href="https://x.com/AlexVolloFPL/status/2088362557769724068?s=20"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color">Alex Vollo on Twitter/X</mark></a></strong> (Do follow).</li>



<li>Thomas is most likely the preferred CB partner to Amenda, but some doubts remain about whether Kitching might take his spot or Amenda&#8217;s spot. </li>



<li>Yirenkyi (5.0 Mid) looks good for DEFCON, he picked up 9 DCs and an assist in their last friendly. </li>



<li>Coventry are set to sign Awoniyi from Forest and with Wright injured he could go straight in </li>
</ul>



