<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Ipswich Town Pre-Season Keynotes:</h3>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Dara O&#8217;Shea is expected to be a definite starter along with Diop and Davis, but if Gary O&#8217;Neil prefers to start Greaves and Diop in the CB roles, then O&#8217;Shea moves to the right back role. However, if Greaves is benched, then O&#8217;Shea starts as the CB with Furlong as the RB. If <strong>O&#8217;Shea plays in the RB role, his DEFCON appeal drops.</strong></li>



<li>O&#8217;Shea started in the RB role in their last two friendlies, and he did score a wonderful goal in their final friendly!</li>



<li>Walle Egeli (£4.5m Forward) started again in their final friendly. He doesn&#8217;t look to be a long-term option, but if Ipswich don&#8217;t sign someone soon, he could be a decent BB1/BB2 option.</li>
</ul>



