		<category><![CDATA[No Haaland FPL Drafts]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://allaboutfpl.com/?p=84544</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>FPL Team Structure plays a big role in managing your FPL team. In this blog, we look at multiple FPL team structures for the 26/27 season.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://allaboutfpl.com/2026/08/2026-2027-fpl-team-structure-guide-with-drafts-ratings/">2026/2027 FPL Team Structure Guide with Drafts &amp; Ratings</a> appeared first on <a href="https://allaboutfpl.com">ALLABOUTFPL: Your one stop place for all FPL tips, FPL captain picks, FPL news, FPL players, previews, reviews,differential picks, analysis and weekly updates.</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In this article, let us take a detailed look at the FPL Team Structure, Price Points, and discuss all the possible team structures with Drafts, Pros, Cons, and Keynotes.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://allaboutfpl.com/category/ultimate-2026-27-fpl-pre-season-guide/" data-type="link" data-id="https://allaboutfpl.com/category/ultimate-2026-27-fpl-pre-season-guide/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color"><strong>Link to all our 2026/27 Pre-Season articles</strong></mark></a> including all team pre-season friendly updates, best drafts, fixture analysis, position-wise analysis, differentials, players to target, budget enablers and more. Completely free to access as well!</p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">A Guide to FPL Team Structure | 2026/27 FPL Season</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">FPL Team Structure refers to nothing but the orientation or the making of your FPL team based on positions, prices, and formation. It is important to understand team structure while building your FPL team due to a variety of reasons, especially at the start of the season, due to the large number of unknown variables in the game. It is crucial to know your team structure due to a variety of reasons-</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Importance of FPL Team Structure</h3>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Flexibility (Moving from one player/position/formation to another)</li>



<li>Reduce the number of hits</li>



<li>Potential routes to highly owned EO players that you don&#8217;t own</li>



<li>Money in the bank</li>
</ul>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Price Points and Players to Target:</h3>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Goalkeepers</h3>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>£6.0 &#8211; POTENTIAL TRAGET</strong> &#8211; Raya</li>



<li><strong>£5.5 &#8211; LIKELY AVOID</strong> &#8211; Pickford </li>



<li><strong>£5.0 &#8211; TARGET-</strong> Lammens, Kelleher, Sanchez, Roefs, Trafford</li>



<li><strong>£4.5 &#8211; TARGET</strong>&#8211; Kinsky, Verbruggen, Petrović, Leno</li>



<li><strong>£4.0 &#8211; BENCH FODDER</strong>&#8211; No likely starters </li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Defenders: </strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>£4.0 &#8211; BENCH FODDER</strong>&#8211; Bobby Thomas, Van Ewijk, Diop, O&#8217;Shea</li>



<li><strong>£4.5 &#8211; TARGET</strong> &#8211; Kadioglu, Shaw, Konsa, Aina, Rodon, Ajer</li>



<li><strong>£5.0 -TARGET</strong>&#8211; Ballard, Muharemović, Vuskovic, Williams, Van Hecke</li>



<li><strong>£5.5 &#8211; MUST TARGET</strong>&#8211; Mosquera/Calafiori/White, Gvardiol, Palestra</li>



<li><strong>£6.0 &#8211; NEUTRAL</strong>&#8211; Virgil, Tarkowski, Nico O&#8217;Reilly/Guehi</li>



<li><strong>8.0 &#8211;</strong> <strong>NEUTRAL</strong> &#8211; Gabriel</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Midfielders: </strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>£12.0 &#8211; MUST TARGET</strong> &#8211; Bruno</li>



<li><strong>£9.5 &#8211; TARGET</strong>&#8211; Palmer, Saka</li>



<li><strong>£8.5 &#8211; TARGET</strong>&#8211; Semenyo</li>



<li><strong>£8.0 &#8211;</strong> <strong>MUST TARGET</strong> &#8211; Mbeumo, Cunha, Gibbs White</li>



<li><strong>£7.0- 7.5</strong> <strong>&#8211; TARGET &#8211;</strong> Rogers, Szoboszlai, Wirtz, Bruno G</li>



<li><strong>£6.5 &#8211;</strong> <strong>NEUTRAL &#8211;</strong> Sarr, Anderson, Wilson, Eze, Tzolis, Rayan, Dango, Estevao</li>



<li><strong>£6.0 &#8211; MUST TARGET</strong> <strong>&#8211;</strong> Le Fee, Ndiaye, Manzambi, Buendia, Schade, Stach</li>



<li><strong>£5.5 &#8211; TARGET &#8211;</strong>  Mamadou Sangare, Ampadu, Pascal Groß, João Gomes</li>



<li><strong>£5.0 &#8211; WAIT and WATCH</strong>&#8211; Caleb Yirenkyi, Florentino Luis, Azor Matusiwa, Norgaard</li>



