<h2 class="wp-block-heading">FPL Team Structures</h2>


<div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter size-large is-resized"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="1024" src="https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-58-1024x1024.png" alt="" class="wp-image-84664" style="width:575px;height:auto" srcset="https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-58-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-58-300x300.png 300w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-58-150x150.png 150w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-58-768x768.png 768w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-58-600x600.png 600w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-58.png 1080w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>
</div>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Haaland (£15.5), Bruno (£12.0) and Gabriel (£8.0) are priced as Tier 1 </strong>&#8211; the most expensive players in the game. They are in a league of their own, and they don&#8217;t fall under any price point. So we will use their names directly in the article. So, for the ease of understanding and convenience of the article, the next set of expensive midfielders (Palmer, Saka, Semenyo) are listed as Premium Midfielders. Watkins, Thiago, and Isak are classified as Premium Forwards. Defenders between £5.5 and £ 6.0<strong> are listed as Premium Defenders</strong>.</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Haaland</strong> &#8211; Haaland</li>



<li><strong>Bruno</strong> &#8211; Bruno</li>



<li><strong>Gabriel</strong> &#8211; Gabriel</li>



<li><strong><a href="https://allaboutfpl.com/2026/08/best-premium-fpl-midfielders-8-0-12-0-million-26-27-season/" data-type="post" data-id="84319"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color">Premium Midfielders</mark></a></strong> (8.0 &amp; above) &#8211; Saka, Palmer, Mbeumo, Cunha, Semenyo </li>



<li><strong>Premium Forwards</strong> (8.0 &amp; above) &#8211; Thiago, Watkins, Isak</li>



<li><strong><a href="https://allaboutfpl.com/2026/07/best-premium-fpl-defenders-for-the-2026-27-fpl-season/" data-type="post" data-id="84091"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color">Premium Defenders</mark></a></strong> &#8211; All DEFs from 5.5- 6.5 Mil &#8211; Van Dijk, Mosquera, O&#8217;Reilly, Gvardiol, Hill, Tarkowski, Munoz, etc</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">For the understanding of this blog, we have divided this article into <strong>6 Team structures</strong> built around them-</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Haaland + Bruno + Two Premium Midfielders + 3 Premium Defenders</strong></li>



<li><strong>Draft with Haaland + Bruno + 1 Premium Midfielder + 2 Premium Defenders</strong></li>



<li><strong>Haaland + Bruno + 1 Premium Midfielder + 1 Premium Defender</strong></li>



<li><strong>Haaland + Bruno + Gabriel + 1 Premium Midfielder</strong></li>



<li><strong>Haaland + 3 Premium Midfielders + 2 Premium Defenders (No Bruno)</strong></li>



<li><strong>Bruno + 2 Premium Midfielders + 3 Premium Defenders + 1 Premium Forward (No Haaland) + GW1 Bench Boost</strong></li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Note: </strong>The players mentioned here in the drafts are just a placeholder for the price points, and you can switch around if you feel it would be better.</p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">FPL Team Structures</h2>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Team Structure 1 &#8211; Draft with Haaland + Bruno + Two Premium MIDs + 3 Premium DEFs</h3>


<div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter size-full is-resized"><a href="https://go.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/ai-team-rating?utm_source=affiliate&amp;utm_medium=affiliates&amp;utm_campaign=allaboutfpl&amp;utm_content=team-rating&amp;via=allaboutfpl" target="_blank" rel=" noreferrer noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="850" height="861" src="https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-42.png" alt="FPL Team Structure 1 - Draft with Haaland + Bruno + Two Premium MIDs + 3 Premium DEFs" class="wp-image-84605" style="aspect-ratio:0.9872371683041044;width:670px;height:auto" srcset="https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-42.png 850w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-42-296x300.png 296w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-42-768x778.png 768w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-42-600x608.png 600w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 850px) 100vw, 850px" /></a><figcaption class="wp-element-caption"><strong><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color">AI Team Rating:</mark> 93%</strong> (<strong><a href="https://go.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/ai-team-rating?utm_source=affiliate&amp;utm_medium=affiliates&amp;utm_campaign=allaboutfpl&amp;utm_content=team-rating&amp;via=allaboutfpl" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color">Get your FPL Team Rated for FREE</mark></a></strong>)</figcaption></figure>
</div>


<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>This draft is rated 93% on <strong><a href="https://go.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/ai-team-rating?utm_source=affiliate&amp;utm_medium=affiliates&amp;utm_campaign=allaboutfpl&amp;utm_content=team-rating&amp;via=allaboutfpl"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color">FFHUB</mark></a></strong> and is fairly template with Haaland + Bruno along with Joao Pedro. </li>



<li>Semenyo and Mbeumo are the other premium midfielders, the benefit of going with both of them is you can get to Saka/Palmer easily if needed based on their performance. The other advantage of going with 2 Premium Midfielders is that you can also downgrade to Wirtz/Szoboszlai/Foden price range if needed to spread out the funds. </li>



<li>Defence has three premium defenders with Mosquera, Gvardiol and Calafiori. Multiple premium defenders enables you to switch to other premium defenders easily. </li>



<li>One 5.0 and one 5.5 midfielder are both DEFCON Midfielders slots, which have Sangare and Gomez currently. Alternative options (5.0 &#8211; Caleb Yirenkyi/Florentino Luis/Matusiwa) (5.5 &#8211; Ampadu/Gross/Xhaka)</li>



<li>4.5 Forward is a dead spot in this structure which is the only caveat. If one of Igor Jesus/DCL/Osula have an excellent start to the season and become a must own pick(in terms of value)- You might be scrambling to get them in your team. </li>



<li>If you are going ahead with this structure, you should not plan Bench Boost in GW1/GW2 but the team is set long term. Late Wildcard followed by Late Bench Boost should be the play. </li>
</ul>



