<figure class="aligncenter size-full"><a href="https://go.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/ai-team-rating?utm_source=affiliate&amp;utm_medium=affiliates&amp;utm_campaign=allaboutfpl&amp;utm_content=team-rating&amp;via=allaboutfpl" target="_blank" rel=" noreferrer noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="859" height="867" src="https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-48.png" alt="FPL Team Structure 3 - Haaland + Bruno + Gabriel + 1 Premium Midfielder" class="wp-image-84612" srcset="https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-48.png 859w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-48-297x300.png 297w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-48-150x150.png 150w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-48-768x775.png 768w, https://cdn.allaboutfpl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-48-600x606.png 600w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 859px) 100vw, 859px" /></a><figcaption class="wp-element-caption"><strong><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color">AI Team Rating:</mark> 92%</strong> ( <strong><a href="https://go.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/ai-team-rating?utm_source=affiliate&amp;utm_medium=affiliates&amp;utm_campaign=allaboutfpl&amp;utm_content=team-rating&amp;via=allaboutfpl" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color">Get your FPL Team Rated for FREE</mark></a></strong>)</figcaption></figure>
</div>


<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>This is a Draft with<strong> </strong>Haaland + Bruno + Gabriel + 1 Premium Midfielder</li>



<li>The main caveat of spending 8.0 million on Gabriel is that it considerably weakens the rest of the team. It has 3 defenders from 4.5-5 million price point while the 5.5 Premium Defender price point is where the value and flexibility is. The midfield is also reduced to a 5.0-5.5-6.0 combination which is decent on paper but could be a cause of concern with few injuries/early transfers. </li>
</ul>



